  "template": "<div lang=\"es\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/coleccion/polimero-mundial/nigeria-naira/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Central Bank of Nigeria — 5 y 10 Naira\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/coleccion/polimero-mundial/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Catálogo de Billetes de Polímero Mundial</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Billetes de Polímero Mundial &middot; Nigeria &middot; 2009</span>\n        <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Central Bank of Nigeria</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Tres billetes de polímero de la serie 2009: 5, 10 y 50 Naira</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ============ 5 NAIRA ============ -->\n      <section style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 32px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px); line-height:1.1; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 10px;\">5 Naira &middot; 2009</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Naira Biyar &middot; Sir Abubakar Tafawa Balewa &middot; Danzantes Nkpokiti</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"nigeria-5-naira-2009-polimero\"\n            aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete de 5 Naira\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"uploads/nigeria-cbn-5-naira-2009-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"uploads/nigeria-cbn-5-naira-2009-polimero.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Billete de 5 Naira de polímero del Central Bank of Nigeria, anverso arriba con retrato de Sir Abubakar Tafawa Balewa, reverso abajo con danzantes Nkpokiti, el escudo de armas y un mapa de Nigeria\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"627\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Ampliar\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">País</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Nigeria</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Entidad Emisora</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Central Bank of Nigeria (CBN)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denominación</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Cinco Naira (&#8358;5)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polímero &mdash; sustrato Guardian&reg;</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Giesecke &amp; Devrient (Alemania)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup> &mdash; el formato de 7 dígitos en el número de serie indica producción alemana (Pick-38b.2); variantes de 6 dígitos fueron impresas por Nigerian Security Printing &amp; Minting Company</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Año de Emisión</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Serie de polímero 2009<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Firmas</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Sanusi Lamido Sanusi (Gobernador) &middot; Benjamin Chuks Onyido (Director de Operaciones de Moneda y Sucursales)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">3</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensiones</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">130 &times; 72 mm<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">4</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Rareza</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Billete corriente, en circulación activa</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-38b (Pick-38b.2 para el formato de 7 dígitos), Standard Catalog of World Paper Money</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Contexto Histórico y de Emisión</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Homenaje al primer Primer Ministro:</strong> el anverso retrata a Alhaji Sir Abubakar Tafawa Balewa, primer Primer Ministro de Nigeria (1912&ndash;1966), figura central de la independencia del país.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Impreso en Alemania:</strong> Giesecke &amp; Devrient imprimió la mayoría de los ejemplares de esta serie sobre sustrato de polímero Guardian&reg;; ciertas subvariantes fueron impresas de forma dividida por Nigerian Security Printing &amp; Minting Company dentro de Nigeria.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave Visibles en el Billete</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> retrato de Alhaji Sir Abubakar Tafawa Balewa y el logo del Central Bank of Nigeria, con una marca táctil en forma de rombo en la esquina superior izquierda para personas con discapacidad visual.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> danzantes Nkpokiti tradicionales con tambores, el escudo de armas de Nigeria y un mapa del país con los colores de la bandera nacional.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">5</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Texto multilingüe:</strong> hausa (&ldquo;Naira Biyar&rdquo;), yoruba (&ldquo;N&aacute;&iacute;r&agrave; M&aacute;r&ugrave;n-&uacute;n&rdquo;) e igbo (&ldquo;Naira Ise&rdquo;).</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ventana transparente:</strong> ventana lisa en la parte superior derecha, con un sello estampado del logo del Central Bank of Nigeria (CBN).</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Imagen de sombra:</strong> diseño opacificado en el sustrato que revela las letras &ldquo;CBN&rdquo; al trasluz.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">6</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> tonos malva, rosado y subimpreso en naranja claro.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:64px auto; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.16);\"></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ 10 NAIRA ============ -->\n      <section style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 32px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px); line-height:1.1; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 10px;\">10 Naira &middot; 2009</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Naira Goma &middot; Dr. Alvan Ikoku &middot; Lecheras Fulani</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"nigeria-10-naira-2009-polimero\"\n            aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete de 10 Naira\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"uploads/nigeria-cbn-10-naira-2009-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"uploads/nigeria-cbn-10-naira-2009-polimero.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Billete de 10 Naira de polímero del Central Bank of Nigeria, anverso arriba con retrato de Alvan Ikoku, reverso abajo con dos lecheras fulani, el escudo de armas y un mapa de Nigeria\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"625\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Ampliar\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">País</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Nigeria</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Entidad Emisora</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Central Bank of Nigeria (CBN)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denominación</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Diez Naira (&#8358;10)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polímero &mdash; sustrato Guardian&reg;</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Giesecke &amp; Devrient (Alemania)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup> &mdash; variantes de 7 dígitos indican producción alemana (Pick-39b.2); variantes de 6 dígitos fueron impresas por Nigerian Security Printing &amp; Minting Company</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Año de Emisión</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Serie de polímero 2009<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Firmas</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Sanusi Lamido Sanusi (Gobernador) &middot; Benjamin Chuks Onyido (Director de Operaciones de Moneda y Sucursales)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">3</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensiones</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">130 &times; 72 mm<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">4</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Rareza</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Billete corriente, en circulación activa</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-39b (Pick-39b.2 para el formato de 7 dígitos), Standard Catalog of World Paper Money</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Contexto Histórico y de Emisión</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Homenaje a un educador nigeriano:</strong> el anverso retrata al Dr. Alvan Ikoku (1900&ndash;1971), destacado educador, activista y político nigeriano, con una marca táctil cuadrada en la esquina superior izquierda para personas con discapacidad visual.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Impreso en Alemania:</strong> al igual que el billete de 5 Naira, Giesecke &amp; Devrient imprimió la mayoría de los ejemplares sobre sustrato Guardian&reg;, con variantes locales a cargo de Nigerian Security Printing &amp; Minting Company.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave Visibles en el Billete</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> retrato de Dr. Alvan Ikoku y el logo del Central Bank of Nigeria.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> dos lecheras fulani portando recipientes decorativos de leche sobre la cabeza, el escudo de armas de Nigeria y un mapa del país con los colores de la bandera nacional.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Texto multilingüe:</strong> hausa (&ldquo;Naira Goma&rdquo;), yoruba (&ldquo;N&aacute;&iacute;r&agrave; M&eacute;w&agrave;&aacute;&rdquo;) e igbo (&ldquo;Naira Iri&rdquo;).</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ventana transparente:</strong> ventana totalmente transparente en el lado derecho del anverso, con un sello estampado del logo del CBN.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Imagen de sombra:</strong> característica opacificada del sustrato que revela las letras &ldquo;CBN&rdquo; al trasluz.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> tonos rojos, naranja ladrillo y subimpreso multicolor.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:64px auto; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.16);\"></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ 50 NAIRA ============ -->\n      <section style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 32px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px); line-height:1.1; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 10px;\">50 Naira &middot; 2009</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Naira Hamsin &middot; Cuatro Ciudadanos Nigerianos &middot; Pescadores</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"nigeria-50-naira-2009-polimero\"\n            aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete de 50 Naira\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"uploads/nigeria-cbn-50-naira-2009-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"uploads/nigeria-cbn-50-naira-2009-polimero.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Billete de 50 Naira de polímero del Central Bank of Nigeria, anverso arriba con retrato compuesto de cuatro ciudadanos nigerianos, reverso abajo con pescadores sosteniendo una captura de pescado, el escudo de armas y un mapa de Nigeria\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"635\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Ampliar\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">País</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Nigeria</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Entidad Emisora</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Central Bank of Nigeria (CBN)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denominación</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Cincuenta Naira (&#8358;50)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polímero &mdash; sustrato Guardian&reg;</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Giesecke &amp; Devrient (Alemania)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup> &mdash; variantes de 7 dígitos indican producción alemana (Pick-41b.2); variantes de 6 dígitos fueron impresas por Nigerian Security Printing &amp; Minting Company</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Año de Emisión</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Serie de polímero 2009<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Firmas</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Sanusi Lamido Sanusi (Gobernador) &middot; Benjamin Chuks Onyido (Director de Operaciones de Moneda y Sucursales)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">3</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensiones</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">130 &times; 72 mm<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">4</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Rareza</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Billete corriente, en circulación activa</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-41b (Pick-41b.2 para el formato de 7 dígitos), Standard Catalog of World Paper Money</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Contexto Histórico y de Emisión</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Retrato colectivo:</strong> a diferencia de otras denominaciones, el anverso presenta un retrato compuesto de cuatro ciudadanos nigerianos comunes que representan la diversidad étnica y cultural del país, con una marca táctil triangular en la esquina superior izquierda.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Impreso en Alemania:</strong> al igual que las demás denominaciones de esta serie, Giesecke &amp; Devrient imprimió la mayoría de los ejemplares sobre sustrato Guardian&reg;, con variantes locales a cargo de Nigerian Security Printing &amp; Minting Company.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave Visibles en el Billete</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> retrato compuesto de cuatro ciudadanos nigerianos representando distintos grupos étnicos y regiones culturales del país.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> pescadores locales sosteniendo una gran captura de pescado, en alusión a la industria pesquera tradicional del país, junto al escudo de armas y un mapa de Nigeria.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Texto multilingüe:</strong> hausa (&ldquo;Naira Hamsin&rdquo;), yoruba (&ldquo;&Agrave;&aacute;d&#7885;&#769;ta N&aacute;&iacute;r&agrave;&rdquo;) e igbo (&ldquo;Naira Iri Ise&rdquo;).</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ventana transparente:</strong> ventana totalmente transparente en el lado derecho del anverso, con un sello estampado del logo del CBN.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Imagen de sombra:</strong> característica opacificada del sustrato que revela las letras &ldquo;CBN&rdquo; al trasluz.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> tonos azules, grises y subimpreso multicolor.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notas</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. Roberts World Money y Pecunia Banknotes, fichas de catalogación de ejemplares de la serie 2009&ndash;2021: &ldquo;Printer: Giesecke &amp; Devrient&rdquo; (Alemania).</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">2. Roberts World Money. &ldquo;Nigeria 5 Naira&rdquo;, fichas P-38c a P-38m. <em>robertsworldmoney.com</em>: &ldquo;Series: 2009&ndash;2021 Issues.&rdquo;</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">3. Banknote World. &ldquo;Nigeria 5 Naira Banknote, 2011, P-38c.&rdquo; <em>banknoteworld.com</em>: billete firmado por Benjamin C. Onyido y Sanusi Lamido Aminu Sanusi.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">4. Central Bank of Nigeria. &ldquo;&#8358;5 Note.&rdquo; <em>cbn.gov.ng/currency/gallery/N5.html</em>: dimensiones de 130 &times; 72 mm para las denominaciones de la serie.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">5. Pecunia Banknotes. &ldquo;Nigeria &mdash; 5 Naira &mdash; 2011 &mdash; P38d.&rdquo; <em>pecuniabanknotes.org</em>: reverso con mapa de Nigeria, cuatro danzantes Nkpokiti con tambores y escudo de armas.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">6. Banknote World, íd.: &ldquo;it has a CBN watermark&rdquo; &mdash; marca de agua que revela las siglas CBN.</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n    <div\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      aria-label=\"Billete ampliado\"\n      style=\"position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:50; background:rgba(5,5,4,0.94); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\"\n    >\n      <button\n        data-zoom-close\n        aria-label=\"Cerrar\"\n        style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n      >&times;</button>\n\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n        <button\n          disabled=\"true\"\n          aria-label=\"Alejar\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&minus;</button>\n        <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n        <button\n          disabled=\"false\"\n          aria-label=\"Acercar\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&#43;</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div\n        style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\"\n      >\n        <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n          <img\n            src=\"\"\n            alt=\"Billete de Central Bank of Nigeria, vista ampliada\"\n            draggable=\"false\"\n            style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n\n      <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Arrastra para mover &middot; Rueda del ratón para ampliar</span>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  \n\n</div>",
